    "**Based on categorical columns:**\n",
    "\n",
    "Saturday has the highest number of observations, indicating it is the busiest day in the dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "Male customers slightly outnumber female customers. Non-smokers form the majority of observations.\n",
    "\n",
    "Most transactions occur during dinner time, indicating higher activity in the evening."
