  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ef8caa68",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Feature Enginnering\n",
    "Raw tips and bills can mislead, so here we do feature engineering, we gone a add other features to our data and that is **tip's_percentage**, **bill_per_person** for better behaviour analysis."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "65a5b81c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Conclusion:**<br>\n",
    "There is no noticeable difference between genders with respect to tips_percentage<br>\n",
    "While weekends generate higher total bills, tipping behavior (in percentage terms) remains consistent, indicating that customers tip proportionally regardless of the day.<br>\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tip amount increases with total bill, indicating a strong positive relationship between the two variables. The tip percentage remains relatively stable, indicating that customers generally tip a consistent proportion of the total bill.**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "94661967",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['tips_percentage'] = (df['tip']/df['total_bill'])*100\n",
    "df['bill_per_person'] = df['total_bill']/df['size']"
   ]
  },
