  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "13f30dbc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Hypothesis Testing:\n",
    "**A two-sample t-test was conducted to compare tip percentage between smokers and non-smokers. The results showed that the difference was not statistically significant (p > 0.05), indicating that smoking status does not influence tipping behavior.**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 38,
   "id": "cf172d9c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "T-statistic: 0.4796693002669833\n",
      "P-value: 0.6318957776878545\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from scipy.stats import ttest_ind\n",
    "\n",
    "# Separate groups\n",
    "smoker = df[df['smoker'] == 'Yes']['tips_percentage'] #gives series of tips_percentage values of smokers\n",
    "non_smoker = df[df['smoker'] == 'No']['tips_percentage']\n",
    "\n",
    "# Perform test\n",
    "t_stat, p_value = ttest_ind(smoker, non_smoker)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"T-statistic:\", t_stat)\n",
    "print(\"P-value:\", p_value)"
   ]
  },
