    "### Conclusion : \n",
    "**Why Did Linear Regression Win?**\n",
    "\n",
    "This is where your EDA becomes valuable.\n",
    "\n",
    "Remember your scatter plot:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Total Bill vs Tip**\n",
    "\n",
    "The relationship looked almost linear.\n",
    "\n",
    "Your EDA already suggested:\n",
    "\n",
    "Higher bill → Higher tip\n",
    "\n",
    "There weren't many complex patterns that required a sophisticated model.\n",
    "\n",
    "Linear Regression fits this type of relationship naturally.\n",
    "\n",
    "A more complex model doesn't have much additional structure to learn, so it mostly ends up fitting noise.\n",
    "\n",
    "This is why understanding the data before modeling is so important.\n",
    "\n",
